sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant CLI
  participant ERI
  participant Ledger
  participant DBOS
  participant Tool
  participant Outbox
  User->>CLI: ask(request)
  CLI->>ERI: authenticated request envelope
  ERI->>Ledger: persist commitment + receipt intent
  Ledger-->>CLI: commitment ID
  CLI-->>User: concise, truthful receipt
  ERI->>DBOS: start durable job
  DBOS->>Tool: authorized read/side-effect intent
  Tool-->>DBOS: evidence or uncertain effect
  DBOS->>Ledger: result/event and evidence refs
  Ledger->>Outbox: store delivery intent
  Outbox-->>User: channel delivery attempt
  Outbox->>Ledger: confirmed ACK or uncertain
